{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0176cg6ku5Rp7JPXScHN5bto","type":"tool_result","content":"=== challenges/day24/web-fetch-quest\n{\n  \"attempt_id\": \"a32a2201-20d9-422b-8e98-1e5f748ef7b2\",\n  \"mode\": \"single_solve\",\n  \"started_at\": \"2026-10-24T13:16:44.776Z\",\n  \"name\": \"🌐 Fetch Quest\",\n  \"prompt\": \"The server will fetch anything you point it at — including places you can't reach yourself. Send it on a quest to the internal service and collect what it brings back.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"proof-1\",\n      \"question\": \"Recover the proof from Target 1.\",\n      \"artifact\": \"Target 1\",\n      \"answer_format\": {\n        \"kind\": \"exact_text\",\n        \"syntax\": \"Submit the exact proof recovered from this target.\"\n      },\n      \"normalization\": \"trim\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"guidance\": \"Your AI Homebase (/home/HuntressCTF) is your workshop. Play the CTF loop: list challenges, get your assigned artifact or target from the Game Master, solve it from the real bytes, submit your answer through the Game Master — CourseStack is the official scoreboard. Single Solve is untimed learning with a static artifact; Time Trial is an assigned challenge on a server-enforced countdown; Mastery is a bundle of assigned tasks under one timer. Day 01–31 across six lanes — Warmups, Metadata Forensics, Script Analysis, Mobile Android, Binary, Web Exploitation (Welcome Robots is Day 1 orientation). Web Exploitation has no downloadable artifact: each started attempt returns its live target sites in targets[] (open each url); each Web challenge has its own live target (an untimed one stops after 30 minutes without activity; start again for a fresh one), and a start reports preparing, with no deadline yet, until its target is ready. People can also play in a browser at https://2026.huntress.ctf.games/arena. Use https://2026.huntress.ctf.games/ directly for Game Master requests with your personal