(D15). D09\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- Shipping a new day without its class handler: D09, D10, D12, D13 TT all `solver_incomplete`. Write the\"\"\",\n    \"\"\"- Shipping a new day without its class handler: D09, D10, D12, D13, D15 TT all `solver_incomplete`. Write the\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"- A 500 on `{{unknown}}`\"\"\", \"\"\"- SSRF to the default port: D15's internal service listens on 8080; `http://127.0.0.1/<route>` = `fetch_failed`,\n  which reads like \"blocked\" but is just the wrong port. Port ladder first.\n- Combining fields (`title,note`, `*`) in D14 was forbidden; only the single bypassed pair works -- enumerate pairs.\n- A 500 on `{{unknown}}`\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(s.count('\\n'))\nEOF"}}}
